    "sub_name": "暑期校外專業實習(二)",
    "sub_ename": "OFF-CAMPUS SUMMER INTERNSHIP(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要是提供學生進入相關產業實習的機會，目的在加強商業知識與實務的結合，並強化學生的就業專業技能，藉此提升未來從事相關就業的機會。",
    "describe_eh": "The industrial internship program is designed to offer students a value-added opportunity to include relevant work experiences in industries as part of their program of study. The goal is to strengthen students’ professional skills by integrating the theory and practice in business, and increase job employment opportunities.",
